      "golden_response": "Reference approach (passes all 10 cases):\n\n```python\nclass Solution:\n    def twoSum(self, nums: list[int], target: int) -> list[int]:\n        seen = {}\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n            if target - x in seen:\n                return [seen[target - x], i]\n            seen[x] = i\n        return []\n```",
